definitions.closed_loop:
AG3S-TASK-DYNAMIC-MAP closed-loop aggregation (lead, 2026-10-24 KST). CPU only. Numbers only, no judgement.
usage: python tdm_agg.py OUT_JSON
Per configuration and run:
  success / grasp      analysis/<run>.json (analyze_cl.py = analyze_t42 + grasp_robust, the locked IFG-APPLE definition)
  end mode             runs/<conf>/<run>.check.json checks.mode (place_stop = the client's place detection ended the record)
  forbidden contact    replay_ext/<conf>/<run>.json contact_rows (control rows with >= 1 contact substep) in the groups below;
                       the record already ends 2.5 s after the place (client --stop-after-place 2.5)
  esdf ms              server records profile_ms.esdf of every request of the configuration's servers (median / p95)
Groups (the IFG-APPLE-NBC-TARGETSURFACE ts_agg.py groups): neighbour_fruit = hand-fruit_other + robot_other-fruit_other;
basket = hand-crate + robot_other-crate; table = hand-table + robot_other-table; post = hand-obstacle + robot_other-obstacle;
body_target = robot_other-target (a link without contact authority touches the apple). forbidden = any of them.
